  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "summon companion to assist in battle",
    "skill1": "increase own and companion ATK speed",
    "skill2": "periodic enhanced normal attack dealing heavy damage",
    "skill3": "ATK speed scales with companion presence on battlefield",
    "skill4": "bind an enemy and drain their stats",
    "skill5": "reduce normal attacks needed to trigger enhanced attack"
  },
  "play_overview": "Cecia fights alongside a **permanent companion**, raising both their attack speeds and landing periodic **enhanced heavy strikes**. She binds an enemy to **drain their stats**, and attack speed scales while the companion stays on the field. Her ultimate **re-summons the companion** for another burst of pressure. She is a **solid carry** with bind and steady DPS but struggles against **tanky single targets** that resist bind.",
  "counter_overview": "Cecia and her **permanent companion** stack attack speed and **enhanced heavy strikes**, while she **binds a target to drain stats** into both fighters. Race to delete her before companion uptime and bind steal snowball — both defenses are **high**, so lean on true-damage rear pressure with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Himmel]] or [[Ravion]], or [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]]'s Aging inhibit. Park a **tanky frontliner** on the bind so the drain never finds a soft carry."
}
